loom roster guards_before=39 guards_after=40 cold_run=39/39_green
file caravan/README.md a 7,221-byte Door page -- what Caravan is, the five words a system is written in, a real declaration read whole, the three answers an exit code carries, and how to run it
file caravan/LADDER.md the table of all 110 modules and the rung-by-rung record, lifted whole; the 33 missing rows written and the 4 helpers rostered in a second table
file caravan/HARNESS.md the shared-check carry, lap by lap, and the meter that keeps it
file tools/ca/caravan_ladder_roster_witness.rish the 40th standing guard -- four readings gated at zero, both directions proven
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_roster_scan.sh reads the File column against the directory; publishes the corpus size beside the verdict so an empty read can never say clean
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_roster_control.sh twelve behaviors on real directories in a throwaway pen -- six refusals bitten, six honest readings free
file construction/REDS.md row %184 booked and closed; row %179 folded to archive as the pin passed its bound; the headline's three numbers corrected
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri caravan_ladder_roster seated 40th
file construction/CHECKPOINTS.md walk-back `e5d4097ef1` recorded before the split
file construction/ITINERARY.md Now moves to `docs/CRYPTO.md`; the front-door table and the crux paragraph read the landed state
file tools/fixtures/prose_register_scan.sh `caravan/README.md` joins the DOOR roster, reading 5% against a 20% ceiling
file tools/ca/caravan_suite_witness.rish its comment repointed from README.md to LADDER.md, since that is where the rung-by-rung record now lives
